{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>手機或平板裡早已存著一批音樂檔案，卻找不到一個乾淨俐落的播放器？CroMusic 主打無廣告、無帳號、無訂閱的離線播放體驗，適合想把自有歌曲整理成隨身音樂庫的用戶。它不會串流或下載音樂，也無法播放受版權保護（DRM）的曲目。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線播放與歌詞同步</h2>\n<p>CroMusic 支援 MP3、FLAC、WAV、ALAC 等多種格式，直接播放你已擁有的音樂檔案，並顯示內嵌專輯封面與逐行同步歌詞，點按歌詞即可跳轉。透過同一 Wi-Fi 網絡，可在電腦瀏覽器拖放歌曲至 iPhone 或 iPad，甚至直接加入播放清單；連接 CarPlay 後可在車內螢幕瀏覽歌曲與清單，方向盤按鍵同樣可用。內置 10 段均衡器、睡眠計時器與浮動迷你播放器，全程無廣告、無帳號、無訂閱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-147-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-148-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-149-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-150-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-151-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-152-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CroMusic: Offline Music Player</li>\n<li>應用類別：Music</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T02:20:50.368675+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T01:56:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T03:58:11.911262+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T02:17:52.038159+00:00","content_hash":"894ccca187aff042a00d2a3318b55b65b14981f0c42825bf27794ad080dcf7b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}